Mochi models

This repository redistributes converted machine-learning models and data. Mochi
converted them (format conversion, float16 weight storage, and trimming); it did
not train or fine-tune them.

MegaDetector v6 (MDV6-apa-rtdetr-c)
  Microsoft AI for Good Lab. https://github.com/microsoft/Biodiversity
  Weights: https://zenodo.org/records/15398270 (CC-BY-4.0); model listed as
  Apache-2.0 in the MegaDetector model zoo.
  RT-DETRv2 model code: Apache License 2.0, Copyright (c) 2023 lyuwenyu.
  Changes: exported to ONNX with post-processing included.

BioCLIP 2
  Copyright (c) 2023-2026 Imageomics Institute. MIT License.
  https://huggingface.co/imageomics/bioclip-2 (doi:10.57967/hf/5765)
  Changes: image encoder exported to ONNX; weights stored as float16.

TreeOfLife-200M
  Imageomics Institute. Compilation dedicated to the public domain (CC0 1.0).
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/imageomics/TreeOfLife-200M
  Changes: species text embeddings and names trimmed to 79,485 animals.
